OL,3,AHakeem Jeffries nominated to be US
OL,4,ASpeaker of the House
OL,5,
OL,6,FDemocrats in the US House of
OL,7,FRepresentatives have officially
OL,8,Fnominated Hakeem Jeffries to be
OL,9,FSpeaker, setting him on the path to
OL,10,Fbecome the first black lawmaker to lead
OL,11,Fthe chamber.
OL,13,FThe House will elect its new Speaker on
OL,14,F3 January, when the new term begins and
OL,15,FDemocrats will hold a majority of the
OL,16,Fseats. As of Wednesday, Democrats will
OL,17,Fhold at least 257 seats in the US House
OL,18,Fnext year, with 7 races still uncalled.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
