OL,3,AHakeem Jeffries nominated to be US
OL,4,ASpeaker of the House
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe will be the first black person in US
OL,7,Fhistory to hold the role, which is
OL,8,Fthird in line to the presidency, once
OL,9,Fhe is elected, which is widely
OL,10,Fexpected.
OL,12,FJeffries was re-elected as the party
OL,13,Fleader in a closed-door vote on
OL,14,FWednesday. He has served as minority
OL,15,Fleader since 2023.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
